    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tails of the North\u00a0</strong>is a third person story-focused adventure and exploration game. You're a young cat, a survivor from a cat colony ravaged by unstable forces of nature, and you've been given a task to find out what happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After escaping your shattered home, you found yourself following a pair of ravens who carry the symbol of Hovialis on their feathers. Offering your help, you begin to uncover the truth to why the natural order is out of balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your cat!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from plenty of fur colors, eye colors, and ear and tail shapes to give your cat an unique look, and follow the adventure of a main character [b]you[/b] want to see!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk around the beautiful, northern landscape, scale the tall mountainside, or climb up an ancient tree to see <i>everything</i>\u00a0- the choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet quirky characters!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along with a buddy of your choosing, you can meet up to 6 unique characters all over the world! You can talk with them to get to know them better, and some may even have a quest for you. Talk to them at different moments of the story to read dialogue you might otherwise miss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn new skills!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the help of a mentor, you can learn to use your paws for more than just walking; you can break branches and stones! Clean up the temple site, and find mysteries hidden beneath the rubble.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tails of the North\u00a0</strong>is a third person story-focused adventure and exploration game. You're a young cat, a survivor from a cat colony ravaged by unstable forces of nature, and you've been given a task to find out what happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After escaping your shattered home, you found yourself following a pair of ravens who carry the symbol of Hovialis on their feathers. Offering your help, you begin to uncover the truth to why the natural order is out of balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your cat!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from plenty of fur colors, eye colors, and ear and tail shapes to give your cat an unique look, and follow the adventure of a main character [b]you[/b] want to see!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk around the beautiful, northern landscape, scale the tall mountainside, or climb up an ancient tree to see <i>everything</i>\u00a0- the choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet quirky characters!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along with a buddy of your choosing, you can meet up to 6 unique characters all over the world! You can talk with them to get to know them better, and some may even have a quest for you. Talk to them at different moments of the story to read dialogue you might otherwise miss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn new skills!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the help of a mentor, you can learn to use your paws for more than just walking; you can break branches and stones! Clean up the temple site, and find mysteries hidden beneath the rubble.</p>",
    "short_description": "Explore northern lands and it's inhabitants as a young cat. Begin unraveling the mystery of a spirit's disappearance.",
